		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Bilious mosquito-demon the size of a man. Gestates inside the faithful of Chaos until their host dies, at which point the spawn emerges.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 15, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 beak +2 (2d6 + blood drain), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blood Drain</strong>. Attach to bitten target; auto-hit the next round. STR 15+ on turn to remove.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stagnation Aura</strong>. Near-sized slow, lethargic aura centered on spawn. Mortals within WIS 15+ on turn. On failure, can only take action or move. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
